  <!-- Settings: Trait costs -->
  <!-- EN: Trait cost multiplier: {0}% -->
  <UWU_TraitCostMultiplier>特性成本倍率: {0}%</UWU_TraitCostMultiplier>
  <!-- EN: Adjust the material cost of customizing weapons. At 0%, customization is free. Default: {0}%. -->
  <UWU_TraitCostMultiplierDesc>调整自定义武器所需的材料成本。为0%时，自定义无需花费任何材料。默认：{0}%。</UWU_TraitCostMultiplierDesc>
  <!-- EN: Trait refund rate: {0}% -->
  <UWU_TraitRefundRate>特性返还率: {0}%</UWU_TraitRefundRate>
  <!-- EN: The share of a trait's cost that is returned when the trait is removed. Negative traits cost this share to add or remove instead. Default: {0}%. -->
  <UWU_TraitRefundRateDesc>移除特性时返还的特性成本比例。负面特性则相反，添加或移除时都要支付这一比例的成本。默认：{0}%。</UWU_TraitRefundRateDesc>
  <!-- EN: The trait refund rate has no effect while the trait cost multiplier is 0%. -->
  <UWU_RefundRateNoEffect>当特性成本倍率为0%时，特性返还率不起作用。</UWU_RefundRateNoEffect>
  <!-- EN: Derive base cost from crafting recipe -->
  <UWU_UseRecipeBaseCost>根据制作配方推算基础成本</UWU_UseRecipeBaseCost>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the cost of adding a trait will be based on the weapon's crafting recipe. When disabled, every weapon of the same tech level will use the same flat cost, so cheap weapons no longer have cheap traits. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_UseRecipeBaseCostDesc>启用后，添加特性的成本将根据武器的制作配方计算。禁用后，科技等级相同的武器都使用同一个固定成本，因此廉价武器的特性也不再廉价。默认：{0}。</UWU_UseRecipeBaseCostDesc>
  <!-- EN: Rare trait cost cap: {0}x -->
  <UWU_RarityCostCap>稀有特性成本上限: {0}倍</UWU_RarityCostCap>
  <!-- EN: A trait's rarity is how rarely it appears on unique weapons found in the world. Rarer traits cost more, up to this many times their base cost. At 1x, rarity does not affect cost. Default: {0}x. -->
  <UWU_RarityCostCapDesc>特性的稀有度是指它在世界中发现的特化武器上出现得有多罕见。越稀有的特性成本越高，最高可达基础成本的这个倍数。为1倍时，稀有度不影响成本。默认：{0}倍。</UWU_RarityCostCapDesc>
  <!-- EN: Advanced trait minimum cost: {0}% -->
  <UWU_ComplexityFloorScale>太空时代特性最低成本: {0}%</UWU_ComplexityFloorScale>
  <!-- EN: Spacer-tech traits will always cost a minimum number of advanced components, even on weapons made without components, such as melee weapons and bows. At 0%, there is no minimum. Default: {0}%. -->
  <UWU_ComplexityFloorScaleDesc>即使是不使用零部件制作的武器，例如近战武器和弓，太空时代特性也始终至少需要一定数量的高级零部件。为0%时没有最低数量。默认：{0}%。</UWU_ComplexityFloorScaleDesc>
  <!-- EN: This setting has no effect while the trait cost multiplier is 0%. -->
  <UWU_CostSettingNoEffect>当特性成本倍率为0%时，此设置不起作用。</UWU_CostSettingNoEffect>

  <!-- Settings: Prerequisites -->
