  <UWU_MinimumQuality>武器最低品质: {0}</UWU_MinimumQuality>
  <!-- EN: The lowest quality a weapon can have and still be customized. At awful, every weapon qualifies. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_MinimumQualityDesc>武器至少要达到此品质才能自定义。设为极差时，所有武器都符合要求。默认：{0}。</UWU_MinimumQualityDesc>
