  <!-- EN: When enabled, a weapon can only be customized after researching {0}, {1} or {2}, depending on its tech level. When disabled, these projects will be hidden from the research window. Default: {3}. -->
  <UWU_RequireCustomizationResearchDesc>启用后，武器要先完成“{0}”、“{1}”或“{2}”研究才能自定义，具体取决于其科技等级。禁用后，这些研究项目将从研究界面中隐藏。默认：{3}。</UWU_RequireCustomizationResearchDesc>
  <!-- EN: Require weapon crafting research -->
  <UWU_RequireRecipeResearch>需要武器制作研究</UWU_RequireRecipeResearch>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, a weapon can only be customized once the research needed to craft it is complete. For example, customizing a {0} will require {1}. Default: {2}. -->
  <UWU_RequireRecipeResearchDesc>启用后，武器要在制作它所需的研究完成后才能自定义。例如，自定义{0}需要“{1}”研究。默认：{2}。</UWU_RequireRecipeResearchDesc>
