  <!-- EN: The colonist doing the work -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectPawn>执行工作的殖民者</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectPawn>
  <!-- EN: The colonist ordered to customize the weapon must have the skill themselves. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectPawnDesc>被命令自定义武器的殖民者自己必须具备该技能。</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectPawnDesc>
  <!-- EN: The most skilled colonist on the map -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMap>地图上技能最高的殖民者</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMap>
  <!-- EN: At least one colonist on the weapon's map must have the skill. The colonist doing the work does not need it. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMapDesc>武器所在地图上至少要有一名殖民者具备该技能。执行工作的殖民者自己则不需要。</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMapDesc>
  <!-- EN: The most skilled colonist anywhere -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectWorld>任意位置技能最高的殖民者</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectWorld>
  <!-- EN: At least one of your colonists must have the skill, wherever they are, including in caravans and transports. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectWorldDesc>你的殖民者中至少要有一人具备该技能，无论对方身在何处，包括远行队和运输舱中。</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectWorldDesc>
  <!-- EN: Skill requirement -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKind>技能要求</UWU_SkillCheckKind>
  <!-- EN: How much skill is required. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindDesc>需要多高的技能。</UWU_SkillCheckKindDesc>
  <!-- EN: This setting has no effect while the skill check applies to no one. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindNoEffect>技能检查不针对任何人时，此设置不起作用。</UWU_SkillCheckKindNoEffect>
  <!-- EN: Based on the weapon's crafting recipe -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindRecipe>基于武器的制作配方</UWU_SkillCheckKindRecipe>
  <!-- {0} = comma-separated list of tech-tier entries, each formatted with UWU_SkillCheckTierEntry -->
  <!-- EN: Use the skill requirements of the weapon's crafting recipe, so anyone who could craft a weapon can customize it. A weapon without a recipe will require a minimum crafting skill for its tech level: {0}. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindRecipeDesc>使用武器制作配方的技能要求，因此能制作武器的人就能自定义它。没有配方的武器，则按其科技等级要求最低手工技能：{0}。</UWU_SkillCheckKindRecipeDesc>
  <!-- {0} = tech level (lowercase), {1} = required crafting level -->
  <!-- EN: {0} {1} -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckTierEntry>{0} {1}级</UWU_SkillCheckTierEntry>
  <!-- {0} = the tech-level minimums lowest tier first, slash-separated, e.g. 4/5/7/9/12/15 -->
  <!-- EN: Based on the weapon's tech level ({0}) -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindTechTier>基于武器的科技等级（{0}）</UWU_SkillCheckKindTechTier>
  <!-- {0} = comma-separated list of tech-tier entries, each formatted with UWU_SkillCheckTierEntry -->
  <!-- EN: Require a minimum crafting skill set by the weapon's tech level, ignoring its crafting recipe: {0}. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindTechTierDesc>按武器的科技等级要求最低手工技能，忽略其制作配方：{0}。</UWU_SkillCheckKindTechTierDesc>
  <!-- EN: Minimum crafting skill: {0} -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindFlat>最低手工技能: {0}</UWU_SkillCheckKindFlat>
  <!-- EN: Require at least this crafting skill level for every weapon. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindFlatDesc>每把武器都要求至少达到此手工技能等级。默认：{0}。</UWU_SkillCheckKindFlatDesc>
  <!-- EN: Adjusting this slider will select "Minimum crafting skill". -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckFlatSliderSelects>拖动此滑块将选中“最低手工技能”。</UWU_SkillCheckFlatSliderSelects>
  <!-- EN: Weaponsmithing expertise (Vanilla Skills Expanded) -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmith>武器锻造专精（Vanilla Skills Expanded）</UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmith>
  <!-- EN: Require the weaponsmithing expertise from Vanilla Skills Expanded. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmithDesc>要求具备 Vanilla Skills Expanded 中的武器锻造专精。</UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmithDesc>

  <!-- Settings: Miscellaneous -->
  <!-- EN: Allow making weapons unique -->
  <UWU_AllowDefConversion>允许将武器变为特化武器</UWU_AllowDefConversion>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, adding a trait to a weapon that is not unique will turn it into its unique version, and removing every trait will turn it back. When disabled, only weapons that are already unique can be customized, and one with no traits left will stay unique. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_AllowDefConversionDesc>启用后，为非特化武器添加特性会将其变为对应的特化版本，移除全部特性则会变回原样。禁用后，只有本身已是特化武器的武器才能自定义，特性被移除殆尽的武器仍保持为特化武器。默认：{0}。</UWU_AllowDefConversionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable Ideology color options -->
  <UWU_EnableIdeoColors>启用文化颜色选项</UWU_EnableIdeoColors>
  <!-- EN: Show Ideology and miscellaneous color palettes in the weapon customization color picker. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnableIdeoColorsDesc>在武器自定义的取色器中显示文化调色板及其他调色板。默认：{0}。</UWU_EnableIdeoColorsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable structure color options -->
  <UWU_EnableStructureColors>启用建筑颜色选项</UWU_EnableStructureColors>
  <!-- EN: Show the structure color palette in the weapon customization color picker. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnableStructureColorsDesc>在武器自定义的取色器中显示建筑调色板。默认：{0}。</UWU_EnableStructureColorsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce trait colors -->
  <UWU_EnforceTraitColors>强制使用特性颜色</UWU_EnforceTraitColors>
  <!-- EN: Some traits, such as gold inlay and tox rounds, set the color of the weapon. When enabled, a weapon with one of these traits will always use that color. When disabled, adding the trait will select its color, but any other color can be picked instead. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnforceTraitColorsDesc>部分特性，例如黄金镶嵌和剧毒弹，会决定武器的颜色。启用后，带有这类特性的武器将始终使用该颜色。禁用后，添加特性时会选中它的颜色，但也可以改选其他任何颜色。默认：{0}。</UWU_EnforceTraitColorsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce trait count limit -->
  <UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimit>强制特性数量上限</UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimit>
  <!-- EN: Unique weapons found in the world never have more than three traits. When enabled, the same limit will apply to customization. When disabled, a weapon can have any number of traits that do not conflict. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimitDesc>世界中发现的特化武器最多只有三项特性。启用后，自定义时也适用同样的上限。禁用后，武器可以拥有任意数量互不冲突的特性。默认：{0}。</UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce lone trait restrictions -->
  <UWU_EnforceSoleTrait>强制唯一特性限制</UWU_EnforceSoleTrait>
  <!-- EN: Some traits never appear as the only trait on a unique weapon found in the world. When enabled, the same restriction will apply to customization. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnforceSoleTraitDesc>有些特性从不会作为世界中发现的特化武器上的唯一特性出现。启用后，自定义时也适用同样的限制。默认：{0}。</UWU_EnforceSoleTraitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Restrict available traits to discovered weapons -->
  <UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscovered>将可用特性限制为已发现的武器</UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscovered>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, only traits found on unique weapons on your maps or in your caravans can be added. Weapons hidden by fog, sealed away or carried by hostiles do not count. When disabled, every trait can be added. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscoveredDesc>启用后，只有在你的地图或远行队中的特化武器上发现的特性才能添加。被迷雾遮蔽、被封存或在敌对者手中的武器不计算在内。禁用后，所有特性都可以添加。默认：{0}。</UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscoveredDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable ground weapon right-click menu -->
  <UWU_EnableGroundCustomization>启用地面武器的右键菜单</UWU_EnableGroundCustomization>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, right-clicking a weapon on the ground will offer to customize it. When disabled, the right-click menu stays shorter, and weapons can still be customized by selecting them and pressing the Customize button. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnableGroundCustomizationDesc>启用后，右键单击地面上的武器时会提供自定义选项。禁用后，右键菜单会更简短，仍然可以选中武器并点击「自定义」按钮来自定义。默认：{0}。</UWU_EnableGroundCustomizationDesc>

  <!-- Settings: Haul planner -->
  <!-- EN: Sequential -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSequential>逐次</UWU_HaulPlannerSequential>
  <!-- EN: Colonists will carry one stack of ingredients at a time, taking the nearest first, the same way they do for bills. This is simple and predictable, but expensive customizations will take many short trips. -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSequentialDesc>殖民者每次搬运一堆原料，且总是先取最近的，与处理清单时的做法相同。这种方式简单且可预测，但原料消耗大的自定义会产生大量短途往返。</UWU_HaulPlannerSequentialDesc>
  <!-- EN: Sweep -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSweep>巡回</UWU_HaulPlannerSweep>
  <!-- EN: Colonists will plan ahead, using spare inventory space to carry more at once and taking a shorter route between pickups. This takes far fewer trips than Sequential and has almost no effect on performance. -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSweepDesc>殖民者会提前规划，利用剩余的携带空间一次搬运更多，并在各个取货点之间选择更短的路线。往返次数远少于“逐次”，对性能几乎没有影响。</UWU_HaulPlannerSweepDesc>
  <!-- EN: Thorough -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerThorough>彻底</UWU_HaulPlannerThorough>
  <!-- EN: Like Sweep, but colonists will also weigh which stacks to take from when there are several to choose from, instead of always taking the closest. This is slower to plan, but will usually find the shortest trips when ingredients are scattered or carrying capacity is tight. It will fall back to Sweep for hauls too complex to analyze fully. -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerThoroughDesc>与“巡回”类似，但当有多堆可选时，殖民者还会权衡该从哪几堆取用，而不是总取最近的。规划较慢，但在原料分散或携带能力紧张时，通常能找到最短的路线。对于过于复杂而无法完整分析的搬运，会回退为“巡回”。</UWU_HaulPlannerThoroughDesc>

</LanguageData>
